---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Waasila Asif.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <!-- Rewrite this page in your own voice. The facts are right; the tone should be yours. -->
    <p>
      I'm Waasila Asif, a computer science student at NUST SEECS in Islamabad, class of 2028.
      I came to CS through mathematics and stayed for the part where you find out what the machine
      is actually doing.
    </p>
    <p>
      My focus is systems and security: how programs become processes, how binaries are laid out,
      and how all of that can be abused. I'm working through CS:APP and pwn.college, building
      <a href="https://github.com/WaasilaAsif/pyelf-teach">pyelf-teach</a>, and contributing to
      open-source security tooling.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm tech lead at GDG on Campus NUST, where I look after the AI/ML, web development and
      cybersecurity teams. Before that I interned as a MERN and Android developer.
    </p>

    <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a></li>
      <li><a href={SITE.medium}>Medium</a></li>
      {SITE.linkedin && <li><a href={SITE.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a></li>}
      <li><a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a> for new posts</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="contact-me">Contact me</h2>
    <p>Questions about a post, an opportunity, or just hello. It comes straight to my inbox.</p>
  </div>
  <ContactForm />
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>This site</h2>
    <p>
      Built with Astro, hosted on Cloudflare. No analytics, no cookies. Set in Instrument Sans
      and JetBrains Mono.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
